Sakana AI Agentic Scientist native local-api investigation extension
Upstream: https://github.com/SakanaAI/AI-Scientist-v3
Base: 2b8aa39285c35aaca3b0e06dd121061ef8a2d854
License: upstream Apache-2.0; retain its LICENSE and source attribution.

Native idea/research source authoring through one pinned direct API.
Full-pipeline, drafting, paper and parallel-worker integration remain unfinished.
The stock submodule is unchanged; apply only to a separate exact checkout.

